\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Computes the exponential `e^x` of a floating-point number.\n\nThis function does not reduce in the kernel. It is implemented in compiled code by the C function\n`expf`.\n","docLink":"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32.exp","kind":"opaque","line":432,"name":"Float32.exp","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Data/Float/Float32.lean#L432-L438"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">opaque</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32.atanh\"><span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">atanh</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Computes the hyperbolic arc tangent (inverse tangent) of a floating-point number.\n\nThis function does not reduce in the kernel. It is implemented in compiled code by the C function\n`atanhf`.\n","docLink":"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32.atanh","kind":"opaque","line":425,"name":"Float32.atanh","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Data/Float/Float32.lean#L425-L431"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">opaque</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32.acosh\"><span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">acosh</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Computes the hyperbolic arc cosine (inverse cosine) of a floating-point number.\n\nThis function does not reduce in the kernel. It is implemented in compiled code by the C function\n`acoshf`.\n","docLink":"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32.acosh","kind":"opaque","line":418,"name":"Float32.acosh","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Data/Float/Float32.lean#L418-L424"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">opaque</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32.asinh\"><span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">asinh</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Computes the hyperbolic arc sine (inverse sine) of a floating-point number.\n\nThis function does not reduce in the kernel. It is implemented in compiled code by the C function\n`asinhf`.\n","docLink":"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32.asinh","kind":"opaque","line":411,"name":"Float32.asinh","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Data/Float/Float32.lean#L411-L417"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">opaque</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32.tanh\"><span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">tanh</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Computes the hyperbolic tangent of a floating-point number.\n\nThis function does not reduce in the kernel. It is implemented in compiled code by the C function\n`tanhf`.\n","docLink":"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32.tanh","kind":"opaque","line":404,"name":"Float32.tanh","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Data/Float/Float32.lean#L404-L410"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">opaque</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32.cosh\"><span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">cosh</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Computes the hyperbolic cosine of a floating-point number.\n\nThis function does not reduce in the kernel. It is implemented in compiled code by the C function\n`coshf`.\n","docLink":"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32.cosh","kind":"opaque","line":397,"name":"Float32.cosh","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Init/Data/Float/Float32.lean#L397-L403"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">opaque</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32.sinh\"><span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">sinh</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Computes the hyperbolic sine of a floating-point number.\n\nThis function does not reduce in the kernel. It is implemented in compiled code by the C function\n`sinhf`.\n","docLink":"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.ht